IMPORTANT RESEARCH ETHICS NOTICE:

This project is a research/educational OS experiment targeting Apple Watch Series 4.
The project does NOT:
  - Permanently modify device firmware
  - Erase system partitions
  - Overwrite the bootloader
  - Violate Apple's terms of service in a destructive manner

All hardware experiments are designed to be RAM-only and fully reversible via reboot.
Any exploit usage is for research purposes only on personally-owned hardware.
